<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-DYNAMO-GAZOVIK CHANGE NAME TO FK TYUMEN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DYNAMO-GAZOVIK CHANGE NAME TO FK TYUMEN.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian premier league club from the west Siberian city of Tyumen have changed their name from Dynamo-Gazovik to FK Tyumen, league officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>First division champions in 1996, they have one point from their first two games in this year's premier league.</p>
</text>
